      "writtenOn": "2022-11-12T00:44:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I figure Rust code doesn\u0027t necessarily need to continue with the pattern from the AIDL generated code, but maybe the consistency is worth it?\n\nI would group b/254931669 with your raw exit status concern - though at least it prints the value!",
      "parentUuid": "f54d235c_44157046",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 737,
        "startChar": 27,
