      "writtenOn": "2022-11-14T01:18:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We wanted to distinguish errors from the payload (i.e. non-zero exit code whose meaning is \"partially\" defined by the payload), and errors from infra (the VM, microdroid_manager, ...). The former is delivered via onPayloadFinished, and the latter is delivered via onError.\n\nBut, yes, the previous implementation clearly didn\u0027t consider the exit-by-signal case. I wish that the signal is also reported via onPayloadFinished.",
      "parentUuid": "2395c37a_9312479e",
